\begin{quote}
The final day of Mercedes-Benz Fashion Week Australia kicked off with an explosion of colour in Sydney on Thursday.

The Australiana-themed Romance Was Born presentation - always one of the highlight shows during MBFWA - dazzled attendees with a stand-out collection brimming with design duo Luke Sales and Anna Plunkett's trademark eccentricity, created in collaboration with esteemed artist Linda Jackson.

\section{Summary Generation}
We evaluated both summarization methods described above using a collection of 20 summaries extracted from a range of different news sources, which are given in Table~\ref{tab:summaries}. This range of summary lengths, topics and writing styles are designed to evaluate how our system can generalize to a range of summary styles.

We evaluated these summaries on the following measures:
\begin{itemize}
\item{B-3, ROUGE-L and METEOR} are the most widely used automated metrics for summarization.


\end{table}

\subsection{Case studies for training}
In the first round of the case study for training, the participants are asked to provide a few keywords (e.g., one, two, or three words) for each news article that is related to the articles' key points (i.e., the summary).
In the second round of the case study for training, the participants are asked to summarize the news articles.

